==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
*2 [[Lione Hippoe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**200 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
**2 [[Lione Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Make sure you can stall the Lione Hippoes while dealing good damage to them. You generally shouldn't have trouble with this stage as long as you have most [[Empire of Cats]] [[Treasure]]s and high enough leveled [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]].

